iness \"Top Niche in Web Marketing\" Marketing Segment Services List of Business Divisions for the Marketing Segment Overseas Talent Segment Global HR Business Services of Global HR Segment Areas of Global HR Segment Real Estate Segment IR IR IR TOP Message from the President Management Policy Management Strategy Disclosure Policy Risk information Disclaimer IR News IR Calendar Financial Highlights Stock information Frequently asked questions CONTACT CONTACT Contact TOP Inquiries about our services Inquiries about IR RECRUIT RECRUIT New graduate Staffing/career Staffing General TOP Business leader Staffing Okinawa Office Staffing IT Engineer Staffing Zenken BLOG SITEMAP SITEMAP Sitemap CONTACT US STEP 1 content entry STEP 2 content confirmation STEP 3 transmission completion INQUIRIES ABOUT IR For enquiries from shareholders and investors, only be made by email. Please use the form below to contact us. Please fill in the form and proceed to the confirmation screen. Frequently asked questions are listed in the FAQ section. Please check the FAQs when making an enquiry. Frequently asked questions Some questions may not be answered depending on the content of the enquiry. Please note that IR will not respond to questions that fall into the following categories. Questions concerning undisclosed information (e.g. performance trends) Questions that may fall under the category of 'material facts' under Article 166 of the Financial Instruments and Exchange Act (e.g. shareholder returns, stock price measures, etc.) Questions concerning stock market price movements (e.g. stock price trends, trading techniques) Messages that constitute slander and defamation Questions about individual services Sales and solicitation enquiries Please note that we may not be able to answer questions other than those listed above, depending on the content of the enquiry, and it may take some time to reply. The contents of the responses sent by the Company are addressed to individual shareholders and investors for the purpose of responding to their enquiries. Please refrain from reprinting or secondary use of any part or all of the contents. For other disclaimers, please see the Disclaimer . STEP 1 content entry STEP 2 content confirmation STEP 3 transmission completion Company name (Required) If you are an individual investor, please enter 'individual' Company URL Postal code Japan (single-byte numbers, no hyphens) Address Name (Required) family name first name Telephone number (Required) (single-byte numbers, no hyphens) Email address (Required) (alphanumeric characters) Inquiry details (Required) Protection of personal data (Required) The personal information entered here will only be used for the following purposes: To reply to inquiries regarding Zenken Corporation's business and services Communication and provision of information in our company will be made by telephone, mail, fax, e-mail or other electromagnetic methods. Before contacting us, please read Zenken Corporation’s \" Privacy Policy \" and \" Handling of Personal Information \" and agree to their contents before proceeding to the confirmation screen. If you are a resident of the EU or the UK, please also read our \" GDPR Privacy Policy \". I agree to the above purposes of use and to Zenken Corporation’s \" Privacy Policy \" and \" Handling of Personal Information .\" If you are a resident of the EU or the UK, I also agree to the contents of the \" GDPR Privacy Policy \". confirmation screen TOP Contact TOP Inquiries about IR To the top Zenken, Marketing and Overseas Human Resources. SITEMAP PERSONAL INFORMATION PROTECTION POLICY GDPR Privacy Policy Harassment Prevention Policy for Recruitment Activities CONTACT US The Company has been awarded the Privacy Mark by the Japan Institute for Promotion of Digital Economy and Community (JIPDEC); the Privacy mark is granted to companies that handle personal information appropriately. (C)2026 Zenken Corporation We updated our GDPR Privacy Policy effective May 12, 2026. GDPR Privacy Policy Close",
